   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Can I bring my dog into a civil defense shelter in Korea?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "As of November 2026, pets other than service dogs such as guide dogs are restricted from entering shelters. A bill to change the law has been introduced, but it's wise to decide in advance where you'll stay with your dog in case you can't get into a shelter."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What's the difference between dōkō hinan and dōhan hinan in Japan?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Dōkō hinan means the owner moves together with their pet to a safe place, and dōhan hinan means staying together with the pet at the shelter. Dōkō hinan is the rule, but whether you can share the same room inside a shelter depends on the shelter."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is the US PETS Act?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "It's a law passed in 2006 after Hurricane Katrina in 2005. To receive federal disaster funding, state and local governments must include pets and service animals in their disaster plans. It doesn't apply to private businesses like hotels."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What should go in a dog emergency kit?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Pack at least 3 days of food and water, any medication, a carrier and leash, copies of registration and vaccination records, poop bags and pee pads, and a familiar blanket. You may end up in a crowded place, so it helps to get your dog used to a muzzle ahead of time."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "How did refugees from Ukraine take their dogs with them?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "In 2022 the EU temporarily eased entry requirements such as microchip and rabies paperwork for pets of refugees from Ukraine only. This exception ended in June 2023. Keeping your dog's registration and vaccination records in order makes situations like this much easier."
   }
  }
